        </section>
      <div v-if="selectedEvaluationDataset" class="modal-backdrop" @click.self="selectedEvaluationDataset = null"><section class="dialog dataset-detail-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dataset-detail-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div class="dialog-symbol"><Gauge :size="19" /></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="关闭测评集详情" @click="selectedEvaluationDataset = null"><X :size="18" /></button></div><h2 id="dataset-detail-title">{{ selectedEvaluationDataset.name }}</h2><p>{{ selectedEvaluationDataset.description || '维护输入、期望结果和评分规则。' }} · {{ selectedEvaluationDataset.case_count }} 条样本</p><div class="dataset-detail-toolbar"><strong>样本列表</strong><div class="dataset-detail-actions"><button class="button button-subtle" @click="openImportCasesDialog"><ArrowDownToLine :size="14" />批量导入样本</button><button class="button button-subtle" :disabled="snapshotBusy" @click="saveDatasetSnapshot"><Archive :size="14" />{{ snapshotBusy ? '保存中…' : '保存版本快照' }}</button><button class="button button-subtle" @click="openCaseDialog()"><Plus :size="14" />新增样本</button></div></div><div class="dataset-case-list"><article v-for="item in selectedEvaluationDataset.cases" :key="item.case_id" class="dataset-case-row"><div><strong>{{ item.case_id }}</strong><p>{{ item.input_text }}</p><small>期望输出：{{ item.expected_output || '未设置' }}</small></div><div class="dataset-case-actions"><button class="text-action" @click="openCaseDialog(item)">编辑</button><button v-if="item.case_id" class="text-action danger" @click="deleteDatasetCase(item)">删除</button></div></article><div v-if="!selectedEvaluationDataset.cases.length" class="ui-empty"><span>暂无样本</span></div></div><div class="dataset-snapshot-list"><strong>版本快照</strong><div v-if="evalSnapshots.length" class="ui-table ui-cols-history"><div v-for="item in evalSnapshots" :key="item.snapshot_id" class="ui-row"><span>{{ item.created_at || '—' }}</span><strong>v{{ item.version }}</strong><span>{{ item.payload?.name || selectedEvaluationDataset.name }}</span><b>{{ item.payload?.case_count ?? 0 }} 条样本</b><code>{{ item.snapshot_id }}</code></div></div><div v-else class="ui-empty"><span>暂无版本快照</span><small>保存快照后可回溯测评集版本</small></div></div><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary-button" type="button" @click="selectedEvaluationDataset = null">关闭</button></div></section></div>
      <div v-if="showCaseDialog" class="modal-backdrop" @click.self="showCaseDialog = false"><section class="dialog run-create-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="case-create-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div class="dialog-symbol"><FileText :size="19" /></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="关闭样本编辑" @click="showCaseDialog = false"><X :size="18" /></button></div><h2 id="case-create-title">{{ caseDraft.caseId ? '编辑测评样本' : '新增测评样本' }}</h2><label class="run-create-field"><span>测试输入</span><textarea v-model="caseDraft.input" rows="4" placeholder="输入要回放的问题或任务" autofocus></textarea></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>期望输出</span><textarea v-model="caseDraft.expectedOutput" rows="3" placeholder="可选，填写期望结果"></textarea></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>语义指标模板</span><select v-model="caseDraft.semanticMetric" @change="applySemanticTemplate"><option value="">不使用（手写规则）</option><option v-for="item in semanticMetricTemplates" :key="item.metric" :value="item.metric">{{ item.label }} · {{ item.metric }}</option></select></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>评分规则 JSON</span><textarea v-model="caseDraft.rubric" rows="4" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>多轮用户话术</span><textarea v-model="caseDraft.turns" rows="4" placeholder="一行一句，留空表示单轮"></textarea></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>用户画像（模拟用户）</span><textarea v-model="caseDraft.userProfile" rows="3" placeholder="可选，例如：新员工，只会问流程问题"></textarea></label><p>多轮话术按行填写；填了用户画像则由模型扮演用户继续对话。评分规则可用 minTurns / maxTurns 约束轮数。<template v-if="semanticMetricHint">语义指标 {{ semanticMetricHint.metric }} 需要参数：{{ (semanticMetricHint.required || []).join('、') || '无' }}，在规则 JSON 的 expect 里填写。</template></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary-button" type="button" @click="showCaseDialog = false">取消</button><button class="primary-button" type="button" @click="saveCase">保存样本</button></div></section></div>
      <div v-if="showImportDialog" class="modal-backdrop" @click.self="showImportDialog = false"><section class="dialog run-create-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="import-cases-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div class="dialog-symbol"><FileText :size="19" /></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="关闭批量导入" @click="showImportDialog = false"><X :size="18" /></button></div><h2 id="import-cases-title">批量导入样本</h2><p>粘贴 JSON 数组，每项必须包含非空的 input 字段，可选 expectedOutput 和 rubric。</p><label class="run-create-field"><span>样本数组 JSON</span><textarea v-model="importCasesText" rows="10" spellcheck="false" placeholder='[{"input":"问题","expectedOutput":"期望","rubric":{}}]'></textarea></label><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary-button" type="button" @click="showImportDialog = false">取消</button><button class="primary-button" type="button" :disabled="importBusy" @click="submitImportCases">{{ importBusy ? '导入中…' : '开始导入' }}</button></div></section></div>
      <div v-if="showDatasetDialog" class="modal-backdrop" @click.self="showDatasetDialog = false"><section class="dialog run-create-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dataset-create-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div class="dialog-symbol"><Gauge :size="19" /></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="关闭新建测评集" @click="showDatasetDialog = false"><X :size="18" /></button></div><h2 id="dataset-create-title">新建测评集</h2><p>测评集只保存测试输入、期望结果和评分规则，不会创建执行任务。</p><label class="run-create-field"><span>测评集名称</span><input v-model="datasetDraft.name" placeholder="例如：客服全链路回归集" autofocus /></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>类型</span><select v-model="datasetDraft.datasetType"><option>通用</option><option>端到端</option><option>RAG</option><option>Tool calling</option><option>Memory</option></select></label><label class="run-create-field"><span>说明</span><textarea v-model="datasetDraft.description" rows="3" placeholder="描述测评集覆盖的能力范围"></textarea></label><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary-button" type="button" @click="showDatasetDialog = false">取消</button><button class="primary-button" type="button" @click="submitDataset">创建测评集</button></div></section></div>
      <div v-if="evalRunDetail" class="modal-backdrop" @click.self="evalRunDetail = null">
        <section class="dialog dataset-detail-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="eval-run-detail-title">
          <div class="dialog-heading"><div class="dialog-symbol"><Gauge :size="19" /></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="关闭测评运行详情" @click="evalRunDetail = null"><X :size="18" /></button></div>
          <h2 id="eval-run-detail-title">{{ evalRunDetail.eval_run_id }}</h2>
          <p>{{ evalStatusLabel(evalRunDetail.status) }} · {{ evalRunDetail.created_at || '—' }} · 测评集 {{ evalRunDetail.dataset_id || '—' }} · 代理 {{ evalRunDetail.agent || '—' }}</p>
          <p v-if="evalRunDetail.error" role="alert">{{ evalRunDetail.error }}</p>
          <p v-if="evalRunDetail.summary">通过率 {{ evalPassRateText }} · 通过 {{ evalRunDetail.summary.passedCount }} / 样本 {{ evalRunDetail.summary.caseCount }}</p>
          <div class="dataset-detail-toolbar"><strong>样本级结果</strong></div>
          <div class="dataset-case-list">
            <article v-for="item in evalRunCases" :key="item.result_id" class="dataset-case-row">
              <div><strong>{{ item.case_id }} · {{ evalVerdictLabel(item.verdict) }} · 得分 {{ item.score }}</strong><p>输入：{{ evalCaseInput(item.case_id) }}</p><small>期望输出：{{ evalCaseExpected(item.case_id) }}<br>实际输出：{{ item.actual_output || '无输出' }}<br>判定说明：{{ item.detail || '无' }}</small></div>
              <button v-if="item.verdict === 'failed' || item.verdict === 'timeout'" class="text-action" type="button" :disabled="evalRunBusy" @click="replayEvalCase(evalRunDetail.eval_run_id, item.case_id)">回放</button>
            </article>
